[
{
"text": "It's three in the morning",
"s": 0,
"e": 1.432
},
{
"text": "in an emergency room",
"s": 1.527,
"e": 3.146
},
{
"text": "A doctor is meeting a woman",
"s": 3.17,
"e": 4.364
},
{
"text": "with cancer for the first time",
"s": 4.384,
"e": 6.382
},
{
"text": "And nobody in that room",
"s": 6.402,
"e": 7.9
},
{
"text": "knows what she wants",
"s": 7.92,
"e": 9.7
},
{
"text": "So her family has to have the hardest",
"s": 9.759,
"e": 11.739
},
{
"text": "conversation of their lives",
"s": 11.759,
"e": 13.65
},
{
"text": "all over again",
"s": 13.67,
"e": 15.146
},
{
"text": "In India, ninety-eight percent",
"s": 16.009,
"e": 17.739
},
{
"text": "of people with advanced",
"s": 17.759,
"e": 18.918
},
{
"text": "cancer don't get the",
"s": 18.938,
"e": 20.275
},
{
"text": "palliative care they need",
"s": 20.295,
"e": 22.075
},
{
"text": "Yes, you heard that right",
"s": 22.17,
"e": 24.039
},
{
"text": "Ninety-eight",
"s": 24.491,
"e": 25.521
},
{
"text": "That's why we built Sahara",
"s": 26.009,
"e": 27.7
},
{
"text": "It's an app for people with cancer",
"s": 27.956,
"e": 29.561
},
{
"text": "and for the families who look after them",
"s": 29.581,
"e": 32.364
},
{
"text": "We're five people who",
"s": 32.384,
"e": 33.257
},
{
"text": "met at Health-a-thon",
"s": 33.277,
"e": 34.754
},
{
"text": "Basith and Awaiz run a software",
"s": 35.134,
"e": 36.971
},
{
"text": "company called WeDevIT",
"s": 36.991,
"e": 38.843
},
{
"text": "Dr Sujay is from IISc, Bengaluru",
"s": 39.402,
"e": 42.968
},
{
"text": "Dr Sharada is from AIIMS, Mangalagiri",
"s": 43.402,
"e": 46.396
},
{
"text": "And Shirin is a final-year",
"s": 46.545,
"e": 47.9
},
{
"text": "medical student",
"s": 47.92,
"e": 49.218
},
{
"text": "Back in August, we had",
"s": 49.259,
"e": 50.525
},
{
"text": "our first team meeting",
"s": 50.545,
"e": 51.986
},
{
"text": "And Dr Sujay told us something",
"s": 52.17,
"e": 53.686
},
{
"text": "that stayed with all of us",
"s": 53.706,
"e": 55.504
},
{
"text": "Patients do tell you what",
"s": 55.831,
"e": 56.739
},
{
"text": "they want at the end of life",
"s": 56.759,
"e": 58.504
},
{
"text": "But nobody writes it down",
"s": 58.563,
"e": 60.311
},
{
"text": "And in an emergency, nobody can find it",
"s": 60.331,
"e": 63.611
},
{
"text": "So we did what technical people do",
"s": 63.938,
"e": 65.989
},
{
"text": "We built everything",
"s": 66.009,
"e": 67.361
},
{
"text": "Screen after screen, all for doctors",
"s": 67.474,
"e": 70.004
},
{
"text": "Then we asked ourselves one question",
"s": 70.402,
"e": 72.932
},
{
"text": "Why would a family install all this?",
"s": 73.152,
"e": 75.221
},
{
"text": "So we pivoted, towards the",
"s": 75.241,
"e": 77.043
},
{
"text": "patient and the family",
"s": 77.063,
"e": 79.057
},
{
"text": "And we kept one thing at the centre",
"s": 79.813,
"e": 82.096
},
{
"text": "the goals of care talk",
"s": 82.116,
"e": 83.825
},
{
"text": "That's when the doctor",
"s": 84.152,
"e": 85.436
},
{
"text": "the patient and the family sit",
"s": 85.456,
"e": 87.293
},
{
"text": "down together, and decide",
"s": 87.313,
"e": 88.846
},
{
"text": "what kind of care she wants",
"s": 88.866,
"e": 90.968
},
{
"text": "With everyone's consent",
"s": 91.081,
"e": 92.596
},
{
"text": "the doctor records that talk",
"s": 92.616,
"e": 94.646
},
{
"text": "AI writes out who said what",
"s": 95.027,
"e": 97.218
},
{
"text": "For Indian languages, we use Sarvam AI",
"s": 97.313,
"e": 100.611
},
{
"text": "Then the AI checks that",
"s": 100.724,
"e": 102.204
},
{
"text": "nothing important was missed",
"s": 102.224,
"e": 104.146
},
{
"text": "It goes through thirteen topics",
"s": 104.188,
"e": 105.65
},
{
"text": "taken from India's",
"s": 105.67,
"e": 106.918
},
{
"text": "end-of-life care guidelines",
"s": 106.938,
"e": 108.186
},
{
"text": "written by the national critical",
"s": 108.206,
"e": 109.846
},
{
"text": "care and palliative care societies",
"s": 109.866,
"e": 112.521
},
{
"text": "Then the AI turns the conversation",
"s": 113.295,
"e": 115.168
},
{
"text": "into a goals of care document",
"s": 115.188,
"e": 117.664
},
{
"text": "That's a clinical record of her wishes",
"s": 117.688,
"e": 119.932
},
{
"text": "Does she want CPR?",
"s": 120.063,
"e": 121.432
},
{
"text": "A ventilator?",
"s": 121.706,
"e": 122.829
},
{
"text": "Intensive care?",
"s": 122.849,
"e": 124.182
},
{
"text": "And where does she want to be cared for?",
"s": 124.206,
"e": 126.504
},
{
"text": "Nothing is final until the doctor",
"s": 126.866,
"e": 128.614
},
{
"text": "reads it, corrects it, and signs it",
"s": 128.634,
"e": 131.829
},
{
"text": "Then the family signs too",
"s": 131.849,
"e": 133.775
},
{
"text": "and it's locked",
"s": 133.795,
"e": 135.057
},
{
"text": "We also took legal advice on the",
"s": 135.759,
"e": 137.436
},
{
"text": "wording and the format of that document",
"s": 137.456,
"e": 139.9
},
{
"text": "But goals of care is only the start",
"s": 139.92,
"e": 142.629
},
{
"text": "Sahara stays with the family",
"s": 143.42,
"e": 144.471
},
{
"text": "every single day",
"s": 144.491,
"e": 146.521
},
{
"text": "Patients track their symptoms",
"s": 146.688,
"e": 148.486
},
{
"text": "They rate how they're feeling",
"s": 148.563,
"e": 149.561
},
{
"text": "on a distress thermometer",
"s": 149.581,
"e": 151.132
},
{
"text": "and they mark where it",
"s": 151.152,
"e": 152.114
},
{
"text": "hurts on a body map",
"s": 152.134,
"e": 153.718
},
{
"text": "Their doctor can see how",
"s": 154.081,
"e": 155.114
},
{
"text": "it's changing over time",
"s": 155.134,
"e": 156.789
},
{
"text": "There's a mood journal, for the days",
"s": 157.027,
"e": 158.364
},
{
"text": "that are hard to put into words",
"s": 158.384,
"e": 160.2
},
{
"text": "They take a photo of a prescription",
"s": 160.349,
"e": 161.632
},
{
"text": "or a medicine strip",
"s": 161.652,
"e": 163.593
},
{
"text": "AI works out the medicines",
"s": 164.116,
"e": 165.239
},
{
"text": "and reminds them about every dose",
"s": 165.259,
"e": 167.914
},
{
"text": "They upload their reports",
"s": 168.099,
"e": 169.257
},
{
"text": "and ask a question in plain words",
"s": 169.277,
"e": 172.164
},
{
"text": "AI answers, and shows the exact",
"s": 172.474,
"e": 174.829
},
{
"text": "line in the report it came from",
"s": 174.849,
"e": 176.846
},
{
"text": "Their next hospital visit is",
"s": 176.866,
"e": 178.507
},
{
"text": "scheduled right in the app",
"s": 178.527,
"e": 180.307
},
{
"text": "Family members get their own login",
"s": 181.045,
"e": 182.329
},
{
"text": "so everyone stays in the loop",
"s": 182.349,
"e": 184.754
},
{
"text": "There's an emergency SOS button",
"s": 184.991,
"e": 187.471
},
{
"text": "And a QR card that carries the patient's",
"s": 187.491,
"e": 190.025
},
{
"text": "wishes, contacts and medicines",
"s": 190.045,
"e": 192.611
},
{
"text": "We also scraped public listings",
"s": 192.92,
"e": 194.793
},
{
"text": "and put over sixteen hundred",
"s": 194.813,
"e": 196.436
},
{
"text": "palliative care centres",
"s": 196.456,
"e": 197.686
},
{
"text": "from across India, on one map",
"s": 197.706,
"e": 200.468
},
{
"text": "It even shows where to find oral morphine",
"s": 200.599,
"e": 203.65
},
{
"text": "And there's a community",
"s": 203.67,
"e": 205.043
},
{
"text": "so no family goes through this alone",
"s": 205.063,
"e": 207.521
},
{
"text": "Families don't talk in just one language",
"s": 207.902,
"e": 210.346
},
{
"text": "So Sahara understands",
"s": 210.366,
"e": 211.632
},
{
"text": "English, Hindi, Telugu",
"s": 211.652,
"e": 214.343
},
{
"text": "Urdu and Kannada, even when",
"s": 214.509,
"e": 216.65
},
{
"text": "they're mixed in one sentence",
"s": 216.67,
"e": 218.557
},
{
"text": "Now, back to that emergency room",
"s": 218.616,
"e": 220.757
},
{
"text": "One scan of her QR card, and the",
"s": 220.777,
"e": 222.775
},
{
"text": "doctor knows exactly what she wanted",
"s": 222.795,
"e": 225.254
},
{
"text": "Oh, wait. Late one night",
"s": 225.474,
"e": 227.9
},
{
"text": "something hit us",
"s": 227.92,
"e": 229.132
},
{
"text": "We kept asking how the patient feels",
"s": 229.152,
"e": 231.361
},
{
"text": "Nobody was asking her daughter",
"s": 231.491,
"e": 233.132
},
{
"text": "So caregivers get their own wellbeing",
"s": 233.152,
"e": 235.087
},
{
"text": "check too, and someone to call",
"s": 235.107,
"e": 237.879
},
{
"text": "All of this took three months",
"s": 238.384,
"e": 240.632
},
{
"text": "We had a lot of meetings with our doctors",
"s": 240.652,
"e": 243.025
},
{
"text": "We met our mentor for a review",
"s": 243.045,
"e": 245.061
},
{
"text": "And we ran a survey of",
"s": 245.081,
"e": 246.454
},
{
"text": "doctors and hospitals",
"s": 246.474,
"e": 248.132
},
{
"text": "We saved our work to GitHub",
"s": 248.152,
"e": 249.686
},
{
"text": "almost six hundred times",
"s": 249.706,
"e": 251.843
},
{
"text": "Each of those is called a commit",
"s": 252.045,
"e": 254.111
},
{
"text": "It's one more improvement to the app",
"s": 254.402,
"e": 256.521
},
{
"text": "It's built with free",
"s": 256.581,
"e": 257.507
},
{
"text": "and open-source tools",
"s": 257.527,
"e": 259.007
},
{
"text": "and it runs on a cloud server",
"s": 259.027,
"e": 261.164
},
{
"text": "When Sahara got shortlisted",
"s": 261.402,
"e": 263.043
},
{
"text": "we rebuilt it as a full Android app",
"s": 263.063,
"e": 265.775
},
{
"text": "And it's live on Google Play today",
"s": 265.795,
"e": 268.629
},
{
"text": "Sahara. Care that follows",
"s": 269.134,
"e": 271.186
},
{
"text": "what matters to the patient",
"s": 271.206,
"e": 272.968
}
]